---
// DengueArchitecture.astro - Pipeline y Arquitectura Técnica Serverless
---

<section class="dengue-arch-section" id="arquitectura">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <span class="section-eyebrow font-mono">INGENIERÍA CLÍNICA Y DATOS DE SALUD</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Arquitectura serverless <span class="gradient-text-red">sin coste de servidor</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Infraestructura escalable y ligera: computación perimetral (Edge) y almacenamiento estructurado en la nube de Google.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Pipeline Diagrama Visual Interactivo -->
    <div class="pipeline-flow" role="list">
      <!-- 1. Telegram Bot -->
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-badge font-mono">CANAL CÍVICO</div>
        <div class="flow-icon">🤖</div>
        <h3 class="flow-title">Telegram Bot</h3>
        <p class="flow-code font-mono">@AlertaDengueRDbot</p>
        <p class="flow-desc">Canal conversacional para reportar criaderos y fiebres en segundos.</p>
        <div class="flow-latency font-mono">&lt; 30 ms</div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-arrow font-mono" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>

      <!-- 2. Cloudflare Worker -->
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-badge font-mono">EDGE WORKER</div>
        <div class="flow-icon">⚡</div>
        <h3 class="flow-title">Cloudflare Worker</h3>
        <p class="flow-code font-mono">alerta-dengue-bot</p>
        <p class="flow-desc">Respuesta HTTP 200 en &lt;50ms a Telegram. Reenvío seguro a Apps Script sin fallas de 302.</p>
        <div class="flow-latency font-mono">&lt; 50 ms</div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-arrow font-mono" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>

      <!-- 3. Google Apps Script -->
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-badge font-mono">BACKEND V8</div>
        <div class="flow-icon">⚙️</div>
        <h3 class="flow-title">Google Apps Script</h3>
        <p class="flow-code font-mono">doPost / doGet / V8</p>
        <p class="flow-desc">Eliminación de duplicados a 30 m, anonimización criptográfica y agregación horaria.</p>
        <div class="flow-latency font-mono">Proceso batch</div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-arrow font-mono" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>

      <!-- 4. Sheets & Drive -->
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-badge font-mono">DATOS Y GEOJSON</div>
        <div class="flow-icon">📊</div>
        <h3 class="flow-title">Sheets & Drive</h3>
        <p class="flow-code font-mono">k-anonimato (k ≥ 5)</p>
        <p class="flow-desc">Almacenamiento tabular, supresión de sectores con menos de 5 casos y polígonos territoriales.</p>
        <div class="flow-latency font-mono">Caché 10 min</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Puntos de Ingeniería Clave -->
    <div class="arch-details-grid">
      <div class="arch-card">
        <div class="arch-icon-pill">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="arch-card-title">Privacidad por diseño (Ley núm. 172-13)</h4>
        <p class="arch-card-text">
          Cifrado unidireccional SHA-256. Las coordenadas GPS del reporte de fiebre se eliminan tras clasificar el sector territorial.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-card">
        <div class="arch-icon-pill">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m16 12-4-4-4 4M12 16V8"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="arch-card-title">Detección con umbrales estadísticos</h4>
        <p class="arch-card-text">
          Alerta automática de tensión cuando los reportes febriles superan significativamente la media histórica del sector, evitando falsas alarmas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-card">
        <div class="arch-icon-pill">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"/><path d="M2 10h20"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="arch-card-title">API pública en caché (10 min)</h4>
        <p class="arch-card-text">
          Endpoint GeoJSON optimizado que alimenta el mapa web en GitHub Pages con alta disponibilidad y cero coste de servidor.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dengue-arch-section {
    padding: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 6rem) 0;
    background: #0B0E17;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .section-header {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .section-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.2vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-lead {
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.6vw, 1.08rem);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Pipeline */
  .pipeline-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .flow-step {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.65rem 1.15rem;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    position: relative;
  }

  .flow-step:hover {
    border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1);
  }

  .flow-badge {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .flow-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .flow-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .flow-code {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.08);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .flow-desc {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .flow-latency {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: #10B981;
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .flow-arrow {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  /* Arch Details Grid */
  .arch-details-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .arch-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.75rem;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }

  .arch-card:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .arch-icon-pill {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
  }

  .arch-card-title {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .arch-card-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .pipeline-flow {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .flow-arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      margin: -0.25rem auto;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .flow-step {
      padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
